  -> Đã gọi tool: smart_home.light_set({"device_id": "light_kitchen", "power": "on", "brightness": 50}) => Kết quả: {"ok": true, "item": {"id": "light_kitchen", "name": "đèn bếp", "type": "light", "room": "bếp", "floor": 1, "state": {"power": "on", "brightness": 50}}}
